SystemRequirements: C++20, Fortran on Unix, FAISS C++ development library
    (Debian/Ubuntu: libfaiss-dev, libblas-dev, liblapack-dev;
    RPM distributions: faiss-devel, blas-devel, lapack-devel where
    available; macOS: static FAISS and OpenMP supplied through the R-macos
    recipes/toolchain or a compatible local prefix; Windows: an
    Rtools-compatible FAISS CPU build), complete LP64 BLAS and LAPACK with
    single-precision routines on Linux and Windows. Optional CUDA and cuVS
    libraries are used only when a GPU-enabled build is explicitly requested.
